OL,3,GNEWSAFive lifeboat stations to get new
OL,4,Avessels by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive lifeboat stations in Devon are to
OL,7,Fget new vessels by 2030 as the RNLI
OL,8,Fupdates its fleet, the rescue charity
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FPlymouth would be among the first
OL,12,Fstations in the country to get the new
OL,13,FCoastal design, replacing its large
OL,14,FSevern class boat; while Salcombe and
OL,15,FTorbay would get new Shannon class
OL,16,Fall-weather boats, bosses said.
OL,18,FAppledore has received a Shannon while
OL,19,FIlfracombe got an Atlantic 85 Mk3
OL,20,Fcraft, a high-speed rigid inflatable,
OL,21,Fto replace its current, larger Shannon
OL,22,Fclass boat, they added.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
