OL,3,GNEWSAFive lifeboat stations to get new
OL,4,Avessels by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said data showed the majority of
OL,7,Fincidents were now within reach of an
OL,8,Finshore lifeboat and 98% of responses
OL,9,Fwere within 10 nautical miles (11.5
OL,10,Fmiles, 18.8km) of shore between 2017
OL,11,Fand 2025.
